{#
    Item Tag Badges -- the tags of one item as chips.

    Renders each assigned tag as a light Bulma chip, labelled in the guest's locale with
    source-locale fallback. Only the leaf-most tags are shown, so an ancestor the write-time
    closure carried along stays out. Renders nothing when the item carries no tags, so callers
    can include it unconditionally.

    Used in:    dishes / books / films list layouts and detail pages, glossary
    Parameters:
        - itemType (string, required) -- registry key of the item type (e.g. 'dish')
        - itemId   (int, required)    -- id of the item whose tags to render
    Depends on: item_tag_labels() (ItemTagExtension)
#}
{% set tags = item_tag_labels(itemType, itemId) %}
{% if tags is not empty %}
    <div class="tags item-tag-badges">
        {% for tag in tags %}
            <span class="tag is-light">{{ tag }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
{% endif %}
